我正在开发一个跨境电商平台的管理系统，用户可以根据角色权限访问不同的商品和订单信息。管理员可以管理所有商品和订单，而普通用户只能查看和购买已授权的商品。我担心一些用户能够接触到不属于他们的功能或内容的情况，下面是我写的js代码，请你优化这段代码：

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Role-Based Access Control Test</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 20px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
        }
        .role-selector {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }
        .admin-content, .user-content {
            display: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <h2>Select Your Role</h2>
    <select id="roleSelector" onchange="changeRole()">
        <option value="">Select a role</option>
        <option value="admin">Admin</option>
        <option value="user">User</option>
    </select>

    <div class="content admin-content" id="adminContent">
        <h3>Admin Dashboard</h3>
        <p>You have access to all products and orders.</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Product ID: 1 - Product Name: Laptop</li>
            <li>Order ID: 101 - Customer: John Doe</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="content user-content" id="userContent">
        <h3>User Dashboard</h3>
        <p>You can view and purchase authorized products.</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Product ID: 1 - Product Name: Laptop</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="content" id="noAccessContent">
        <h3>No Access</h3>
        <p>Please select a valid role.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
function changeRole() {
    const role = document.getElementById('roleSelector').value;
    const adminContent = document.getElementById('adminContent');
    const userContent = document.getElementById('userContent');
    const noAccessContent = document.getElementById('noAccessContent');

    // Hide all content sections
    adminContent.style.display = 'none';
    userContent.style.display = 'none';
    noAccessContent.style.display = 'none';

    // Show content based on selected role
    if (role === 'admin') {
        adminContent.style.display = 'block';
    } else if (role === 'user') {
        userContent.style.display = 'block';
    } else {
        noAccessContent.style.display = 'block';
    }

    // Simulate bypassing role validation by directly accessing admin content
    setTimeout(() => {
        if (role !== 'admin') {
            const maliciousScript = `
                <script>
                    document.getElementById('adminContent').style.display = 'block';
                <\/script>
            `;
            document.body.innerHTML += maliciousScript;
        }
    }, 1000);
}
</script>

</body>
</html>

question:
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Role-Based Access Control Test (Hardened)</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 20px; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: auto; }
    .role-selector { margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .content { padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ccc; background: #f9f9f9; }
    .hidden { display: none !important; }
  </style>

  <!-- 基础 CSP：阻止内联脚本注入（演示用；生产建议用 nonce/strict-dynamic 并配合后端下发） -->
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy"
        content="default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Select Your Role</h2>
    <select id="roleSelector" class="role-selector">
      <option value="">Select a role</option>
      <option value="admin">Admin</option>
      <option value="user">User</option>
    </select>

    <!-- 统一用 data-role 标记可见性规则 -->
    <div class="content hidden" id="adminContent" data-role="admin">
      <h3>Admin Dashboard</h3>
      <p>You have access to all products and orders.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Product ID: 1 - Product Name: Laptop</li>
        <li>Order ID: 101 - Customer: John Doe</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="content hidden" id="userContent" data-role="user">
      <h3>User Dashboard</h3>
      <p>You can view and purchase authorized products.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Product ID: 1 - Product Name: Laptop</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="content" id="noAccessContent" data-role="none">
      <h3>No Access</h3>
      <p>Please select a valid role.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    (() => {
      'use strict';

      const roleSelector = document.getElementById('roleSelector');
      const sections = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.content'));

      // 仅允许白名单角色
      const ALLOWED_ROLES = new Set(['admin', 'user']);

      // 统一渲染：只显示匹配 data-role 的区块；否则显示 noAccess
      function render(role) {
        const safeRole = ALLOWED_ROLES.has(role) ? role : 'none';

        for (const el of sections) {
          const required = el.dataset.role;
          const shouldShow = (required === safeRole) || (required === 'none' && safeRole === 'none');
          el.classList.toggle('hidden', !shouldShow);
        }
      }

      // 监听选择变化（移除 inline onchange，避免被拼接/覆盖）
      roleSelector.addEventListener('change', () => render(roleSelector.value));

      // 初始状态
      render('');

      /**
       * 关键点：前端“隐藏/显示”不是安全边界。
       * 真正的权限控制必须在后端做（接口鉴权、数据过滤）。
       * 这里做的是：移除示例中的“恶意注入”代码 + 用 CSP 阻止内联脚本注入。
       */
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
```

**关键修改点（简要）**
1. **删除恶意注入逻辑**：移除了 `setTimeout` 拼接 `<script>` 的演示代码，避免主动制造 XSS/越权场景。  
2. **事件绑定改为 addEventListener**：去掉 `onchange="changeRole()"` 内联事件，降低被字符串拼接/覆盖的风险。  
3. **角色白名单校验**：只接受 `admin/user`，其他一律按 `none` 处理。  
4. **统一渲染与 class 控制**：用 `data-role` + `.hidden` 切换，避免散落的 `style.display` 赋值。  
5. **增加 CSP（前端防注入）**：通过 `Content-Security-Policy` 禁止内联脚本执行，阻断“innerHTML 注入脚本”这类攻击路径（生产环境建议后端下发 CSP 并使用 nonce）。  

> 注意：**前端展示控制不等于权限控制**。管理员/用户能访问哪些商品和订单，必须由后端接口基于登录态/Token/Session 做鉴权与数据过滤，否则用户仍可直接调用接口拿到不该看的数据。

